  "distractor_rules": {
    "roots": [
      "Offer four lowercase words: one right prefixed word and three wrong ones.",
      "Wrong choices must be real words from the wordlist or allowed_extra_words. Never invent a prefix plus base that is not on those lists.",
      "Use the bare base as one distractor on most items.",
      "Other distractors are a different prefix that does not fit, or a same-base near-miss.",
      "Never use remember, missing, or miss as a re- or mis- answer. Those are not Grade 2 prefix uses.",
      "Never let two choices both fit the stem. replace means place again, not place wrong. recount means count again, not count wrong.",
      "Keep stems in kid world: school, home, food, pets, play, family, weather. No brands.",
      "Stems must show again, before, or wrong without using the answer word."
    ]
  },
