  "tier_rules": {
    "1": "Short stems of four to six words. The clue again, before, or wrong is obvious. Distractors are other prefixes plus the bare base.",
    "2": "Grade-level stems of five to eight words. Kid-world sentences with pronouns. Distractors are real pre, re, or mis words that do not fit.",
    "3": "Near-miss same-base pairs such as reread and misread, rewrite and prewrite, or miscount and recount. Stems may use NAME or irregular past."
  },
